{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1482-help-with-relics","id":1482,"title":"Help with Relics","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-02T20:39:26-07:00","id":1482,"title":"Help with Relics","content":"So I'm making a Scion with Anubis as his father and I'm having immense trouble thinking of a Birthright Relic. At the moment, the only idea I have is a leather jacket (somewhat based on <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Imiut_fetish\" target=\"_blank\">Imiut Fetishes</a> used in Funerary Rites (very small connection, both involve animal skins)) and aforementioned jacket would grant Death and Animal (Jackal). <br /> <br /> If anyone cares, it's a black jacket with a small stylized jackal head near the heart. <br /> <br /> Anyone else have any ideas or is that suitable enough?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"right\"><i>!</i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/245-egg","name":"Egg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar245_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-02T21:13:06-07:00","id":1502,"title":"","content":"Do you mean for what form the Relics could take physically, or what they might <i>do</i> function-wise? Purview channels, armor, weapons, unique powers, Follower-keys, etc, that's all possible functions. The function depends on what you want your guy to be doing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T07:02:53-08:00","id":1729,"title":"","content":"What they'd look like physically, mostly","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"right\"><i>!</i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/245-egg","name":"Egg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar245_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T09:37:26-08:00","id":1845,"title":"","content":"What do you want this relic to be able to do? I tend to take a function and move from there towards a form in my relic design.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Games are a way for us to explore what it means to be human, or inhuman, as the case may be. Let's all have a good time playing them.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/400-guitarsniper","name":"guitarsniper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T10:10:31-08:00","id":1857,"title":"","content":"Well, body paint was a big thing in Egypt. He could have magical gold body paint, or magical kohl for his eyes. Magical tiny statues called ushabti that spring to life. Magical canopic jars. Or a magical motorcycle that was made from the melted down metal of an ancient Pharaoh's chariot. It really does depend on what you want the Relics to do and what kind of character you're playing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T19:38:03-08:00","id":2308,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Egg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1482-help-with-relics?p=1729#post1729\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What they'd look like physically, mostly</div> </div> </div> </div>That depends. Is this a relic that you want to grow with the character from Hero to God? Are you wanting it to seem more divine or take on a divine quality as the character progresses. Relics are incredibly individualistic to the characters they're connected to. The jacket you've described already seems to fit for what you'd want and when you've hit demigod, you'd have played the character long enough to have a basic idea of how you'd want to have it grow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/606-aynie","name":"Aynie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar606_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T20:49:22-08:00","id":2338,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aynie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1482-help-with-relics?p=2308#post2308\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That depends. Is this a relic that you want to grow with the character from Hero to God? Are you wanting it to seem more divine or take on a divine quality as the character progresses. Relics are incredibly individualistic to the characters they're connected to. The jacket you've described already seems to fit for what you'd want and when you've hit demigod, you'd have played the character long enough to have a basic idea of how you'd want to have it grow.</div> </div> </div> </div>I only have Hero at the moment. Do Birthrights grow along side the character?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"right\"><i>!</i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/245-egg","name":"Egg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar245_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T21:03:21-08:00","id":2342,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Egg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1482-help-with-relics?p=2338#post2338\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I only have Hero at the moment. Do Birthrights grow along side the character?</div> </div> </div> </div>They can. They don't have to, but it's an option for when a character hits demigod/god.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Games are a way for us to explore what it means to be human, or inhuman, as the case may be. Let's all have a good time playing them.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/400-guitarsniper","name":"guitarsniper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T21:53:14-08:00","id":2380,"title":"","content":"Jackal headed Pimpcane.<br /> <br /> Edit: Think I fucked up the image posting. Shit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-04T07:13:55-08:00","id":2588,"title":"","content":"A egyptian styled Revolver, Various Tatoos or maybe a Egypt Hoodie.<br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://blog.